% Test: Structural hazards on FPdiv unit
% FPdiv has only 1 Reservation Station and latency of 6 cycles.
% Issuing back-to-back fdiv instructions should cause structural stalls.
0, 100
8, 2

fld F0, 0(R0)
fld F2, 8(R0)
fdiv F4, F0, F2   % F4 = 50. Occupies the single FPdiv RS.
fdiv F6, F0, F2   % Issue stalls here until F4 completes because RS is full.
fdiv F8, F6, F2   % Issue stalls again. Also RAW hazard on F6.
fsd F8, 16(R0)
